UpdateApp system-disk rollback
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PASS on y8uio8lxoa74p9pcsip (axle311-upd3).

Caveats required to reach the rollback path (neither is part of this PR):
  1. idea-app-data v7 SYSTEM_ROOT='' makes avail_kb "" call `df` on an empty path.
     `estimate system <id>` printed only `16 8` plus stderr
     `refused: cannot tell the free space of ` and parseEstimate threw
     `idea-app-data estimate gave no result line: 16 8`.
     Temporary one-line patch: avail_kb uses `local dir="${1:-/}"`.
     Same helper is used by snapshot, so the patch was required for rollback too.
     Original helper was restored before release
     (sha256 c8ca658b21501e548b1877e715dbbf699b42eafb9120b110d6aece52e6d8530c).
  2. Scratch bundles initially lacked x-app.name / x-app.version, so createOrUpdateInstance
     set instanceOf to undefined-undefined and updateApp checkUpdate threw DIFFERENT_APP.
     Both /apps/axleproof-1.0 and /apps/axleproof-1.1 were given
     x-app.name: axleproof and version 1.0 / 1.1.
     Intermediate instance h7wd4t350auta0dfnbg (axle311-upd2) was installed then
     removeInstance'd to /.idea-quarantine/h7wd4t350auta0dfnbg-20261111T022829Z.

Successful sequence (engine-out / engine-error):
  App y8uio8lxoa74p9pcsip running          (1.0, port 50589)
  Step 3/6 Snapshot  + stopInstance
  Step 4/6 Swap
  Step 5/6 Start of 1.1
    "Container(s) exited after compose up ... y8uio8lxoa74p9pcsip-web-1: Exited (42)"
    (1.1 compose used `command: ["sh","-c","exit 42"]` and restart: "no" so
    assertComposeContainersHealthy fails fast instead of the 600s health timeout)
  Starting instance 'y8uio8lxoa74p9pcsip' on disk 5vyahbut147hw5dp4e1 ...  (rollback start)
  App y8uio8lxoa74p9pcsip running          (restored 1.0, unless-stopped httpd)
  engine-error:
    ROLLED BACK: Start failed: start failed: Engine error: Container(s) exited after
    compose up for y8uio8lxoa74p9pcsip. Automerge must not stay Running.
    y8uio8lxoa74p9pcsip-web-1: Exited (42) 2 seconds ago. axleproof-1.0 and its data
    were restored from /.pre-update/y8uio8lxoa74p9pcsip
  Failed 1.1 tree:
    /.idea-quarantine/y8uio8lxoa74p9pcsip-before-restore-20261111T023024684363928Z

compose down / up on rollback also use zx .quiet(), so `-f /instances/<id>/compose.yaml`
is not echoed. This head's UpdateApp.composeDown builds that absolute -f via
joinMountRoot/diskPath; startInstance cwd is /instances/<id> on the system disk.
The STEP8 COMPOSE_DOWN_FAILED line is the live echo of the same absolute -f pattern.

